          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.4.7/user-story/beacon-v1.4.7-automation-support-review-truth-refreeze-and-promotion-contract.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Beacon can route support-review outcomes to `implement`, `change_refreeze`, or `human`, without inventing a new primary lifecycle stage.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.4.7/user-story/beacon-v1.4.7-automation-support-review-truth-refreeze-and-promotion-contract.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Beacon can record `truth_recompiled_pending=true` plus explicit downstream target surfaces that must be regenerated before implement resumes.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.4.7/user-story/beacon-v1.4.7-automation-support-review-truth-refreeze-and-promotion-contract.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Beacon blocks `implement` when automation runtime says support review is still required, truth refreeze is required, or truth recompile is still pending.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.4.7/user-story/beacon-v1.4.7-automation-support-review-truth-refreeze-and-promotion-contract.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-006",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Beacon can classify scenario discovery into `closure_supplement` and `promotion_candidate`, with explicit `requirement_meaning_delta` and `requires_truth_reopen` flags.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.4.7/user-story/beacon-v1.4.7-automation-support-review-truth-refreeze-and-promotion-contract.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-007",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Beacon routes `closure_supplement` or requirement-meaning delta into `change_refreeze`, but keeps pure `promotion_candidate` findings in a non-canonical sink without blocking current closure by default.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.4.7/user-story/beacon-v1.4.7-automation-support-review-truth-refreeze-and-promotion-contract.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-008",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Beacon projects promotion-grade proof hooks from current evidence, including acceptance-kit presence, all-layer pass state, real-project proof presence, and missing proof hooks.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.4.7/user-story/beacon-v1.4.7-automation-support-review-truth-refreeze-and-promotion-contract.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-009",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Beacon keeps all new automation runtime behavior inside the support plane: classify, route, explain, and block are allowed; canonical truth mutation and autonomous refreeze are not.",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
